nsumer-vr/People_waiting_outside_technolog…_202607101942.mp4","in":1.56,"text":"They believed that these devices would connect them to a new kind of freedom.","kw":["believed","these","devices","would","connect","them","kind","freedom"],"ch":12},{"t":16.07,"dur":3.92,"clip":"11_oculus/Programmer_illuminated_by_termin…_202607101941.mp4","file":"assets/11_oculus/Programmer_illuminated_by_termin…_202607101941.mp4","in":5.04,"text":"They believed that they could capture the entire world in lines of code.","kw":["believed","could","capture","entire","world","lines","code"],"ch":11},{"t":20.81,"dur":4,"clip":"10_vr-winter/Presenter_unveils_VR_headset_202607101901.mp4","file":"assets/10_vr-winter/Presenter_unveils_VR_headset_202607101901.mp4","in":5.48,"text":"The graphics are absolutely breathtaking, bringing the future right into your living room.","kw":["graphics","absolutely","breathtaking","bringing","future","right","your","living"],"ch":10},{"t":25.91,"dur":3.14,"clip":"09_arcade-era/Reporter_describes_virtual_reali…_202607101900.mp4","file":"assets/09_arcade-era/Reporter_describes_virtual_reali…_202607101900.mp4","in":6.52,"text":"Just step inside one of these futuristic pods.","kw":["just","step","inside","these","futuristic","pods"],"ch":9},{"t":30.56,"dur":3,"clip":"08_vpl/AI_presenter_promising_liberatio…_202607101859.mp4","file":"assets/08_vpl/AI_presenter_promising_liberatio…_202607101859.mp4","in":4.12,"text":"and we will float in a digital void.","kw":["will","float","digital","void"],"ch":8},{"t":35.36,"dur":4,"clip":"07_nasa-view/Military_simulation_room_calibra…_202607101936.mp4","file":"assets/07_nasa-view/Military_simulation_room_calibra…_202607101936.mp4","in":5.88,"text":"They were simply waiting to be told what to do by cold data.","kw":["simply","waiting","told","what","cold","data"],"ch":7},{"t":40.4,"dur":3,"clip":"06_public-grid/Person_talking_to_studio_camera_202607101928.mp4","file":"assets/06_public-grid/Person_talking_to_studio_camera_202607101928.mp4","in":0,"text":"This was the moment when the old illusions began to collapse.","kw":["moment","when","illusions","began","collapse"],"ch":6},{"t":44.94,"dur":4.12,"clip":"05_damocles/Astronauts_undergoing_suspension…_202607101926.mp4","file":"assets/05_damocles/Astronauts_undergoing_suspension…_202607101926.mp4","in":0,"text":"In the 1960s, a new idea of isolation began to emerge.","kw":["idea","isolation","began","emerge"],"ch":5},{"t":49.73,"dur":4.08,"clip":"04_ultimate-display/AI_lecturer_demonstrates_wirefra…_202607101853.mp4","file":"assets/04_ultimate-display/AI_lecturer_demonstrates_wirefra…_202607101853.mp4","in":0,"text":"Here we have the precise digital representation.","kw":["here","have","precise","digital","representation"],"ch":4},{"t":54.52,"dur":4,"clip":"03_sensorama/Inventor's_workshop_demonstratio…_202607101851.mp4","file":"assets/03_sensorama/Inventor's_workshop_demonstratio…_202607101851.mp4","in":0,"text":"In the pursuit of precision, component must work in harmony.","kw":["pursuit","precision","component","must","work","harmony"],"ch":3},{"t":59.63,"dur":3.24,"clip":"02_telesphere/Presenter_demonstrates_cinema_he…_202607101850.mp4","file":"assets/02_telesphere/Presenter_demonstrates_cinema_he…_202607101850.mp4","in":0,"text":"This is not science fiction, my friends. It is here today.","kw":["science","fiction","friends","here","today"],"ch":2},{"t":64.1,"dur":4,"clip":"01_3d-golden/Crowd_entering_movie_palace_theater_202607101842.mp4","file":"assets/01_3d-golden/Crowd_entering_movie_palace_theater_202607101842.mp4","in":4.88,"text":"But they could not see that it was they who were being watched.","kw":["could","being","watched"],"ch":1}],"duck":[[0,1.68,0.55],[1.83,5.92,0.28],[4.79,6.47,0.55],[6.59,10.78,0.28],[9.58,11.26,0.55],[11.41,15.26,0.28],[14.37,16.05,0.55],[16.07,20.24,0.28],[19.16,20.84,0.55],[20.81,25.06,0.28],[23.95,25.63,0.55],[25.91,29.3,0.28],[28.74,30.42,0.55],[30.56,33.81,0.28],[33.53,35.21,0.55],[35.36,39.61,0.28]